"parks on 429s (#1841, #1843, #1844, #1845, #1807, #1808, #1809, #1910, "
"#1912, #2012)"
msgstr ""

#: src/introduction.md:105
msgid ""
"**/respond_to and /cowork (v0.5.5)**: per-channel respond_to and open modes "
"in config, plus the two commands to set them from inside the channel itself "
"(#2014, #2015)"
msgstr ""

#: src/introduction.md:106
msgid ""
"**Telegram rate discipline (v0.5.5)**: instrumented getUpdates polls and "
"handler handoffs for stall triage, a cross-surface sub-second spacing floor "
"with admission telemetry, a per-chat 429 pause behind one Cooldown accessor, "
"and markdown links to local files delivered as documents (#1927, #1916, "
"#1968)"
msgstr ""

#: src/introduction.md:107
msgid ""
"**ACP v1 session lifecycle (v0.5.5)**: the five v1 session lifecycle methods "
"are implemented and the plan is published as a native v1 plan update (#1815)"
msgstr ""

#: src/introduction.md:108
msgid ""
"**TUI dialog footer, clickable URLs, onboarding timeline (v0.5.5)**: every "
"dialog shares one command footer with direct a/r approval verbs, URLs and "
"file paths are clickable, and onboarding is rebuilt as a left-side step "
"timeline with direct setup commands (#1775, #1772, #1979, #1980, #1981, "
"#1982)"
msgstr ""

#: src/introduction.md:109
msgid ""
"**Cron one-shot retirement (v0.5.5)**: one-shot jobs retire on delivery "
"instead of re-firing a year later, every delivered run carries its run id, "
"and Discord cron reports arrive as one forum post (#544, #1703, #1851)"
msgstr ""

#: src/introduction.md:110
msgid ""
"**Zero-setup first run (v0.5.11)**: a fresh install lands in the chat with "
"the built-in provider already provisioned, `config.toml` and `keys.toml` "
"seeded, and the agent greeting you. The wizard is opt-in through `/onboard` "
"or `--onboard` (#2079)"
msgstr ""

#: src/introduction.md:111
msgid ""
"**A first turn that cannot abort the process (v0.5.11)**: agent worker "
"threads run on a 16 MiB stack, so the first turn no longer overflows the "
"default one (#2080)"
msgstr ""

#: src/introduction.md:112
msgid ""
"**Release tags gated on green CI (v0.5.11)**: the release workflow reads the "
