"project's own commands, not always cargo, and find the project from the "
"session's folder"
msgstr ""

#: src/introduction.md:124
msgid ""
"**/stop cancels immediately (v0.3.83)**: interrupts during provider "
"handshake and retry backoffs (#1148)"
msgstr ""

#: src/introduction.md:125
msgid ""
"**A2A session resume (v0.3.83)**: sessions resume by context id, the gateway "
