#: src/getting-started/installation.md:150
msgid "Autostart on Boot"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:152
msgid ""
"Keep OpenCrabs running as a background daemon that starts with your system."
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:154
msgid "Linux (systemd)"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:156
msgid ""
"The binary writes the unit itself, so the file cannot drift from the version "
"you are running:"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:162
msgid ""
"That writes `~/.config/systemd/user/opencrabs.service` with `Type=simple` "
"and `OOMPolicy=continue`, then reloads systemd. Start it with `opencrabs "
"service start`: a user unit does not come back after a reboot unless "
"lingering is enabled (see below), while a system-wide unit is enabled so it "
"does. `OOMPolicy=continue` matters because the daemon is the parent of every "
"tool call and cron child: without it, one child killed by the OOM killer "
"stops the whole unit and takes every agent lane with it. The unit name "
"carries the profile when you are not on `default`, as "
"`opencrabs-<profile>.service`."
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:164
msgid ""
"On a headless SSH session the per-user systemd bus is often missing, and the "
"command fails with `Failed to connect to bus`. Enable lingering so the user "
"service runs without a login, or install a system-wide unit instead:"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:167
msgid "# or\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:172
msgid ""
"Manage the daemon with `opencrabs service start|stop|restart|status`, or "
"with systemctl directly."
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:174
msgid ""
"Check status: `systemctl --user status opencrabs` | Logs: `journalctl --user "
"-u opencrabs -f`"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:176
msgid "macOS (launchd)"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/installation.md:179
msgid ""
"<< 'EOF'\n"
"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n"
"<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN\"\n"
"  \"http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">\n"
"<plist version=\"1.0\">\n"
"<dict>\n"
"    <key>Label</key>\n"
"    <string>com.opencrabs.agent</string>\n"
"    <key>ProgramArguments</key>\n"
"    <array>\n"
"        <string>/usr/local/bin/opencrabs</string>\n"
"        <string>daemon</string>\n"
"    </array>\n"
"    <key>RunAtLoad</key>\n"
"    <true/>\n"
"    <key>KeepAlive</key>\n"
"    <true/>\n"
"    <key>StandardOutPath</key>\n"
"    <string>/tmp/opencrabs.log</string>\n"
"    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>\n"
"    <string>/tmp/opencrabs.err</string>\n"
"</dict>\n"
"</plist>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.opencrabs.agent.plist\n"
msgstr ""

