#: src/getting-started/onboarding.md:99
msgid ""
"Already using ClaudeCode, OpenClaw, Hermes, or any other AI agent harness? "
"Your agent can migrate your existing data (memory, skills, custom commands, "
"preferences) into its own brain files using natural language. No manual file "
"shuffling needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/onboarding.md:101
msgid ""
"This works with **any** agent or coding harness that stores config locally. "
"The migration searches your filesystem for the other tool's config "
"directories, reads their contents, and maps them into OpenCrabs' own brain "
"file format (`SOUL.md`, `USER.md`, `TOOLS.md`, `MEMORY.md`, `AGENTS.md`, "
"`CODE.md`)."
msgstr ""

