#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:33
msgid "`/restart`"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:33
msgid ""
"**Restart** (v0.3.79): Relaunches the same binary with the same arguments, "
"so nothing about how it was started has to be known or repeated. Unfinished "
"turns resume automatically on startup. In the TUI it resumes the current "
"session. Owner-only on channels; announces before acting."
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:34
msgid "`/exit`"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:34
msgid ""
"**Shutdown** (v0.3.79): Shuts OpenCrabs down. Starting it again needs access "
"to the machine it runs on, so this is **the one command with no way back "
"from chat**. Owner-only on channels; announces before acting."
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:35
msgid "`/clear`"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:35
msgid ""
"**Fresh session** (v0.5.2): Closes the current session and starts a blank "
"one in place, without the summariser call, so it is instant. Owner-only on "
"channels."
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:36 src/features/goal.md:61
msgid "`/btw`"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:36
msgid ""
