"main conversation continues. e.g. `/btw research the latest Rust async "
"patterns`"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:37
msgid "`/mission-control`"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:37
msgid ""
"**Mission Control**: Full-screen dashboard showing RSI inbox (pending "
"proposals), activity log (improvements applied), and cron schedule. Navigate "
"with vim keys, apply/reject proposals with `a`/`r`."
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:38
msgid "`/skills`"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:38
msgid ""
"**Skills picker**: Browse and launch workflow templates with fuzzy-finding. "
"Every loaded skill auto-registers as a slash command."
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:39
msgid "`/security-audit`"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started/cli-commands.md:39
msgid ""
"**Security audit**: Comprehensive language-agnostic security & CVE audit. "
"Detects project type, runs the right scanner, reviews recent diff for "
