"key\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/brain/providers.md:357
msgid ""
"Never carry the `custom` path into the reference, and never append the model:"
msgstr ""

#: src/brain/providers.md:359
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"self_improvement_provider = \"custom:moonshotai\"    # ❌ RSI silently never "
"runs\n"
"self_improvement_provider = \"custom.moonshotai\"    # ❌ same\n"
"self_improvement_provider = \"moonshotai/kimi-k2.5\" # ❌ provider-only, "
"model goes in self_improvement_model\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/brain/providers.md:365
msgid ""
"**Real case:** a user with `[providers.custom.glm-53-max]` set "
"`self_improvement_provider = \"custom:glm-53-max\"` and RSI silently never "
"ran, Mission Control showed thousands of tool events recorded and "
"unprocessed. Dropping the `custom:` prefix fixed it instantly "
"([opencrabs#1314](https://github.com/opencrabs/opencrabs/issues/1314)). "
"Current main auto-corrects misspelled values with a warning; released "
"versions fail silently, so spell it bare."
msgstr ""

