#: src/brain/images.md:99
msgid "Incoming Images from Channels"
msgstr ""

#: src/brain/images.md:101
msgid ""
"When a user sends an image from any channel, it arrives as "
"`<<IMG:/tmp/path>>` in the message. The file is already downloaded, the "
"agent can:"
