#: src/brain/images.md:115
msgid "Combine per-frame descriptions into a **chronological summary**"
msgstr ""

#: src/brain/images.md:117
msgid ""
"This means `analyze_video` works even when the video API is unreachable, as "
"long as ffmpeg is installed and at least one vision path (Path A or Path B) "
"is configured. The fallback activates automatically. No user configuration "
"needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/brain/images.md:119
