#: src/brain/images.md:121
msgid ""
"**Path A**: any vision-capable model on your active provider. On OpenRouter: "
"`google/gemini-2.5-flash`, `anthropic/claude-sonnet-4`, `openai/gpt-4o`. On "
"Ollama: `llava`, `bakllava`. On custom endpoints: whatever the server offers."
