#: src/channels/telegram.md:265
msgid "File edits and git operations"
msgstr ""

#: src/channels/telegram.md:266
msgid "Build/test progress"
msgstr ""

#: src/channels/telegram.md:267
msgid ""
"**Wall-clock duration** (v0.3.66): finished/failed/timeout states carry the "
"total turn time"
msgstr ""

#: src/channels/telegram.md:268
msgid ""
"**Bash comments as flow status** (v0.3.66): line-start comments in a bash "
"command surface as live flow status"
msgstr ""

#: src/channels/telegram.md:269
msgid ""
"**Full status preview** (v0.3.66): the status preview uses the whole last "
"human-readable line, no truncation"
msgstr ""

#: src/channels/telegram.md:271
msgid ""
"The flow-log message is edited in-place as each step completes, so the "
"channel stays clean. Users see real-time progress without message spam."
msgstr ""

#: src/channels/telegram.md:273
msgid ""
"Flow blocks **re-stick to the chat bottom** when buried (v0.3.65), so you "
"always see the latest progress without scrolling."
msgstr ""

#: src/channels/telegram.md:275
msgid "Forum Topic Management and /clear (v0.5.2)"
msgstr ""

#: src/channels/telegram.md:277
msgid ""
"The agent can create and rename forum topics (not just route into existing "
"ones), and a group's session can bind to a topic so each topic keeps its own "
"conversation context. `/clear` starts a fresh session in place (the current "
"one closes and a blank one begins) without invoking the summariser, so it is "
"instant and free (#1585)."
