#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:49
msgid "**Reload**: Re-read `tools.toml` without restarting"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:51
msgid ""
"Dynamic tools appear alongside built-in tools in the agent's tool list. "
"Enable or disable individual tools without restarting the process."
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:53
msgid "Per-Parameter Value Coercion (v0.3.24)"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:55
msgid ""
"Dynamic tools defined in `tools.toml` can now handle empty-string or null "
"parameters gracefully. When a parameter arrives as `\"\"` or `null`, the "
"engine substitutes a configured value before rendering the command template."
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:59
msgid "`coerce_empty_to`"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:59
msgid "Substitute when parameter is `\"\"`"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:60
msgid "`coerce_null_to`"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:60
msgid "Substitute when parameter is `null`"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:62
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[[tools]]\n"
"name = \"deploy\"\n"
"description = \"Deploy to environment with optional verbose flag\"\n"
"executor = \"shell\"\n"
"command = \"cd {{project_dir}} && ./deploy.sh --env {{environment}} "
"{{verbose}}\"\n"
"\n"
"[[tools.deploy.params]]\n"
"name = \"verbose\"\n"
"type = \"string\"\n"
"required = false\n"
"coerce_empty_to = \"--quiet\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:76
msgid ""
"A shell tool with an optional `--verbose` flag no longer breaks when the "
"parameter is omitted. The engine substitutes `--quiet` (or any configured "
"default) instead of passing an empty string."
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:78
msgid "([\\#95](https://github.com/opencrabs/opencrabs/issues/95))"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:80
msgid ""
"External contributions now enable `tools.toml` to be loaded in **run mode** "
"and **agent mode** (not just the TUI). Previously, dynamic tools only worked "
"in the interactive TUI session. Now they're available across all modes, "
"allowing headless automation and scripted workflows to use custom tools."
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:82
msgid ""
"([\\#79](https://github.com/opencrabs/opencrabs/issues/79): thanks "
"@leshchenko)"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:84
msgid "Shell Parameter Escaping (v0.3.35)"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/dynamic-tools.md:86
msgid ""
"Dynamic shell tool parameters now properly escape single quotes, preventing "
"command injection edge cases when user-supplied values contain quotes. "
"Contributed by @leshchenko1979."
