#: src/features/self-healing.md:479
msgid ""
"Nothing happens silently. If the crab fixes itself, it tells you what it "
"fixed."
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-healing.md:481
msgid "Early Loop Detection (v0.3.81)"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-healing.md:483
msgid ""
"The loop detector now notices a **repeating tool round before the provider "
"rejects the turn**. Instead of burning the context window on identical "
"rounds and surfacing a provider error, the detector catches the pattern "
"early and routes it through the existing loop-kill path (which reaches the "
"fallback chain since v0.3.80)."
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-healing.md:485
msgid "Fact-Based Detectors Fire the Heal (v0.3.81)"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-healing.md:487
