#: src/features/self-healing.md:489
msgid ""
"**Fact-based detectors self-heal**: detectors that verify against ground "
"truth (files, command output) now fire the self-heal path directly, not just "
"gate the claim"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-healing.md:490
msgid ""
"**Wider command allowlist**: inspection-style claims are checkable, so \"I "
"ran X\" verification covers more real phrasings"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-healing.md:491
msgid ""
"**Dotted commands survive the sentence split**: `some.command --flag` is no "
"longer torn in half when the claim is parsed"
