#: src/features/self-improvement.md:269
msgid "RSI Convergence Gates (v0.3.80)"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-improvement.md:271
msgid "The self-improvement engine now knows when to hold back (#977):"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-improvement.md:273
msgid ""
"**Pauses on convergence self-reports**: when a cycle reports its findings "
"have converged, the RSI agent pauses instead of churning"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-improvement.md:274
msgid ""
"**Interval backs off on zero-improvement streaks**: repeated cycles that "
"improve nothing automatically lengthen the wait before the next cycle"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-improvement.md:275
msgid ""
"**Findings hashed by stable identity**: the same finding keeps the same "
"identity across cycles, so no description churn and no duplicate proposals"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-improvement.md:276
msgid ""
"**Gated on actionable feedback deltas**: cycles only run when there is new "
"actionable feedback to work with"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-improvement.md:277
msgid ""
"**Session history sealed each cycle** with a compaction marker, so every "
"cycle starts from a clean read"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-improvement.md:278
msgid "**Cycle provider resolved from user config**, not registry order"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-improvement.md:280
msgid "RSI Engine Gate (v0.3.81)"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/self-improvement.md:282
msgid ""
"The autonomous RSI engine is gated behind `rsi_enabled` (#1063). In the TUI "
"nothing changes, but **headless daemons default RSI off**, an unattended "
"service no longer rewrites its own brain files by default. Opt in explicitly:"
msgstr ""

