#: src/features/skills.md:47
msgid ""
"When the agent is about to touch a matching path **without that skill loaded "
"in the current context**, the tool call is rejected once, carrying the full "
"skill body in the rejection. The identical retry then passes: the model has "
"now read the rules. A registry of seen skills (track of loads, "
"epoch-tracked) re-arms the gate after context compaction, and the master "
"switch is `[agent] skill_glob_gate` (default: on). The effect: conventions "
"attached to a path are impossible to edit against by omission."
msgstr ""

