#: src/features/web-scrape.md:52
msgid "JS-Shell Detection"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/web-scrape.md:54
msgid ""
"When a page returns mostly empty HTML with JS framework markers (React root, "
"Vue app, Angular bootstrap, Svelte kit), `web_scrape` detects it as a JS "
"shell and escalates to the browser manager if available. This avoids "
"returning empty markdown for single-page applications that require "
"JavaScript rendering."
msgstr ""

#: src/features/web-scrape.md:56
msgid "Image Handling"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/web-scrape.md:58
msgid ""
"Images are preserved as `![alt](url)` markdown tags rather than being "
"stripped. This lets the agent decide which images are worth visioning (via "
"`analyze_image`) and which can be ignored, rather than losing all visual "
"context."
msgstr ""

